  cpp_placement_err_body.pcpp - break step of cpp_placement.pcpp:
  cpp header; inside a body (PR0050)

  How to check, from repo\bin:
    pcpp res\tests\cpp_placement_err_body.pcpp
    pcpp res\tests\cpp_placement_err_body.pcpp -t x86_64-linux-gnu
  The marked line reports that code; nothing else is reported.
*******************************************************************************/

module exe cpp_placement_err_body;

begin
  cpp header; // ERROR PR0050@3: 'cpp header' / 'cpp source' set the placement
end.
